add_claim("The training mode offers six modules: Free Training, Free Kick, Left Corner, Right Corner, Penalty and Penalty Save.", 3, "training/six-modules", [e_skill], notes="A 2016 source - structurally corroborated by the wave-60 corner drill, but verify on device")
add_claim("SKILL-MOVE TECHNIQUE: 'Combine your swipe with your joystick... time it so that you flick your joystick and change the direction of the run WITH the skill move' - it raises the chance of losing the ball but beats the defender outright when it works.", 3, "skillmoves/joystick-combination-technique", [e_skill])
add_claim("Skill moves are most valuable 'when im actually past the defenders and 1 on 1 with the goalkeeper' - they give 'a bit of a speed boost' and more distance from recovering defenders.", 3, "skillmoves/one-on-one-speed-boost", [e_skill])
add_claim("DLS's skill-move set is deliberately SMALLER than FIFA's - a player arriving from FIFA notes 'Shame DLS doesn't have such options'. Do not expect FIFA-level flair to be available.", 3, "skillmoves/smaller-than-fifa", [e_skill])
add_claim("THE THREE-KICK MAPPING (stated independently in two guides): LOW KICK = low, short, precise passes; HARD KICK = shots and long-range through balls; LOFTED KICK = long-ball passes and chipped goals.", 2, "controls/three-kick-mapping", [e_skill])
add_claim("The three action buttons are CONTEXT-DEPENDENT: in possession they pass, shoot and cross; out of possession the same three become press, tackle and change-player. The layout is customisable from the options menu - button size, movement-stick position, and the shooting assistant can be DISABLED.", 2, "controls/context-dependent-buttons-and-customisation", [e_skill])
add_claim("Defending is 'timing and positioning rather than button spamming': hold the pressure button to apply pressure, switch players to stay tight, slide tackle when needed, and goalkeeper charge is available in one-on-ones.", 2, "controls/defensive-controls", [e_skill])
add_claim("THE STADIUM'S SEVEN NAMED PITCH PATTERNS: Horizontal stripe, Vertical stripe, Check, Diagonal A, Diagonal B, Diamond, Circles. The pattern is explicitly 'only a cosmetic upgrade'.", 2, "stadium/seven-named-pitch-patterns", [e_skill])
add_claim("THE STADIUM'S EIGHT NAMED SECTORS: North Stand, North East Stand, East Stand, South East Stand, South Stand, South West Stand, West Stand, North West Stand - 2 Ends, 2 Sides and 4 Corners. Seat colour DEPENDS ON THE HOME KIT COLOUR.", 2, "stadium/eight-named-sectors", [e_skill])
